# L §8.2 (tally 2.3, #247; the lead's ledger under a pin): the ledger's month follows the pinned day of `pw`,
# so the pin was read and its register lists `pinned: w = …`, as on the engine. Before: no `pinned:` line.
=== m.tally
model l1_fulfilled
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247), the plan's §8.4: book/ledger.rs ledger_model on a hole-day instance (MUTANTS-SURVIVORS, the guard exists set to false). pw's day is a window row across March's end, a hole day in 2.3, and an observation dated 2026-03-30 fulfils it: the ledger's line for pw sits in the observation's month, March, and not in April"

source s "s"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input w: date
input bank: observed

move pw: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w = window(2026-03-25, 2026-04-05) "s"

version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-10
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  stated[konto] = 600.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end "s"
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-30, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pw) "r1"

ask r_p25: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04 with w = 2026-03-25
ask r_p05: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04 with w = 2026-04-05
=== expect
r_p05: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04
  2026-03 balance: model 600.00 PLN, observed 600.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    balance konto 2026-03-31 end (padded): booked 600.00 PLN, stated 600.00 PLN, gap 0.00 PLN
  2026-04 move pw: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched pw on 2026-04-05: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing -6 days
  pinned: w = 2026-04-05
  cut 2026-06-10
r_p25: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04
  2026-03 balance: model 600.00 PLN, observed 600.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    balance konto 2026-03-31 end (padded): booked 600.00 PLN, stated 600.00 PLN, gap 0.00 PLN
  2026-03 move pw: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched pw on 2026-03-25: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +5 days
  pinned: w = 2026-03-25
  cut 2026-06-10
